**CSS for Flexbox method:**
```css
.search-wrapper {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  width: 300px;
  border: 2px solid #e1e5e9;
  border-radius: 8px;
  overflow: hidden;
  transition: border-color 0.2s ease;
}

.search-wrapper:focus-within {
  border-color: #007bff;
}

.search-input-flex {
  flex: 1;
  padding: 12px 16px;
  border: none;
  outline: none;
  font-size: 16px;
}

.search-button {
  padding: 12px;
  border: none;
  background: transparent;
  cursor: pointer;
  color: #6c757d;
  transition: color 0.2s ease, background-color 0.2s ease;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
}

.search-button:hover {
  color: #007bff;
  background-color: #f8f9fa;
}
```

